WEBVTT

00:13.860 --> 00:15.370
Is it enjoyable?

00:16.550 --> 00:18.230
Isn't it nothing but pain?

00:19.060 --> 00:22.420
In that case... let's end it!

00:24.890 --> 00:25.600
Why?

01:01.290 --> 01:04.820
S-A-M-A-TARO Samatarou!

01:08.350 --> 01:10.090
Samatarou! Fight!

01:10.240 --> 01:12.090
Victory-y!

01:12.350 --> 01:13.510
What's wrong with you?

01:13.510 --> 01:15.310
No reaction? How cold!

01:19.940 --> 01:23.320
Samatarou! Fight! Victory-y!

01:26.180 --> 01:28.850
<i>L? Mom had a V...</i>

01:28.850 --> 01:30.700
UUU-VICTORY!

01:36.160 --> 01:37.580
Not cute at all.

01:40.500 --> 01:44.010
Brother, fight. Victory-y!

01:42.680 --> 01:46.230
<i>Even Meme? Ugh, my family is really...</i>

01:48.160 --> 01:51.520
Brother, fight. Victory-y!

01:50.060 --> 01:50.530
<i>E?</i>

01:51.860 --> 01:54.590
Brother, fight~

02:14.150 --> 02:14.960
LOVE?

02:15.570 --> 02:16.340
Could...

02:22.840 --> 02:23.740
What?

02:24.360 --> 02:26.170
It should be there... but there's nothing.

02:27.490 --> 02:29.010
Oww!

02:29.010 --> 02:30.210
Where are you looking?

02:30.350 --> 02:32.800
It's not like that, I was...

02:34.240 --> 02:39.250
Oh no! My bacoegg! It burned!

02:39.600 --> 02:43.160
Jeez, do whatever you want, but I'm busy. So could you not bother me?

02:43.850 --> 02:45.270
S-sorry.

02:47.230 --> 02:48.890
Am I thinking about this too much?

02:50.390 --> 02:53.700
Samatarou! Fight! Victory-y!

02:57.250 --> 02:58.200
So it was Pops?

03:21.550 --> 03:26.870
dare mo shiranai basho de

03:21.550 --> 03:26.870
In a place unknown to everyone

03:27.690 --> 03:32.550
asa ga umare hajimeru

03:27.690 --> 03:32.550
The dawn is being born

03:32.910 --> 03:38.990
hoshi inotta negai wo ima wa

03:32.910 --> 03:38.990
The wishes you made upon a star

03:38.990 --> 03:44.890
hikari wo naku shita no ue ni koborete iru

03:38.990 --> 03:44.890
Are spilling forth from where the light had vanished

03:45.190 --> 03:53.800
sotto sukuu tame ni te wo nobasu

03:45.190 --> 03:53.800
I softly extend my hand to rescue you

03:56.990 --> 04:00.120
boku no koe wa sekai wo koete

03:56.990 --> 04:00.120
And my voice envelops the entire world

04:00.140 --> 04:03.210
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

04:00.140 --> 04:03.210
Perhaps some day it will struggle its way to you

04:03.230 --> 04:06.140
toiki morashi yume ga oitemo

04:03.230 --> 04:06.140
Even if you must abandon your dreams, exhale deeply

04:06.390 --> 04:09.280
douka kesshite wasurenu you ni

04:06.390 --> 04:09.280
And you'll never really lose them

04:09.280 --> 04:12.360
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

04:09.280 --> 04:12.360
My fingers touch all of creation

04:12.360 --> 04:17.750
tobira akete haruka kanata e

04:12.360 --> 04:17.750
Open the door and escape to a distant place

04:36.500 --> 04:39.500
First Love, Again...

04:36.500 --> 04:39.500
Translation: rabidkimba; Everything else: Chikushou

04:43.090 --> 04:45.970
Jeez... sometimes I just don't know what my family's thinking.

04:46.470 --> 04:48.640
It seems like they're doing plenty of thinking.

04:48.850 --> 04:50.120
Wha?

04:50.770 --> 04:53.560
You've seemed pretty down lately.

04:54.080 --> 04:55.890
Everyone's worried about you because of that.

04:56.960 --> 05:02.560
Well, ever since that happened, it's felt like there's a hole in my heart.

05:03.650 --> 05:05.950
Since she went away... all the time.

05:07.140 --> 05:10.190
It was only for five days, but she was our child.

05:10.730 --> 05:13.850
Ai. That smiling face and that voice...

05:14.340 --> 05:15.850
They're never coming back.

05:16.170 --> 05:17.360
I found you!

05:17.360 --> 05:19.360
Papa! Mama!

05:20.430 --> 05:21.760
Because that girl...

05:22.200 --> 05:24.630
She's really... a doll, Lulu.

05:24.990 --> 05:28.970
Her wish that she wanted to meet Ai came true.

05:29.700 --> 05:31.890
She just disappeared somewhere.

05:32.650 --> 05:36.970
And almost all of that happened because of one of dad's miracles.

05:39.940 --> 05:42.240
And now, time's been turned back.

05:42.890 --> 05:45.710
Other than me, no one remembers her.

05:46.690 --> 05:53.920
If she had just been able to remember about Ai, we could at least share our memories of her...

06:02.960 --> 06:04.380
What? Is something wrong?

06:04.660 --> 06:05.690
Your face is red.

06:06.310 --> 06:07.320
Do you have a fever or something?

06:11.470 --> 06:15.610
Like I was saying... she even forgot about that kiss.

06:16.010 --> 06:17.650
Curse you, Pops!

06:18.770 --> 06:22.620
I can't really tell... Maybe checking with my forehead would be better.

06:23.850 --> 06:25.670
No, I'm fine!

06:25.890 --> 06:26.710
Really?

06:27.220 --> 06:27.930
Yeah!

06:27.930 --> 06:30.690
Anyway, we'll be late if we keep wasting time like this!

06:35.720 --> 06:37.930
Being together like this with Samatarou...

06:38.800 --> 06:42.950
Is the duty of an angel like me. My happiness!

06:48.040 --> 06:48.840
Hey!

06:48.840 --> 06:52.430
Samatarou! Tenko! Yohoo!

06:57.750 --> 06:58.740
Morning!

06:58.740 --> 06:59.660
Good morning!

07:01.290 --> 07:02.370
Ai is...!

07:03.570 --> 07:04.970
Aw, jeez...

07:05.060 --> 07:06.520
I'm Kirishima Shinichi!

07:06.520 --> 07:09.600
I've started holding hands with Ai!

07:09.770 --> 07:11.600
Oh you, Shinichi...

07:15.600 --> 07:16.780
Nonononono!

07:17.660 --> 07:21.670
The Ai we know and this Ai are different people.

07:21.900 --> 07:22.810
But still...

07:23.990 --> 07:26.330
Why of all people does it have to be Shinichi?

07:26.810 --> 07:30.530
Unbelieveable! Together with that peeping-tom pervert!

07:30.530 --> 07:34.810
I don't know why, but I feel worried for Ai like she was my own daughter!

07:36.920 --> 07:41.180
BREAK UP...

07:41.180 --> 07:41.950
Shinichi!

07:41.950 --> 07:46.360
You're a hundred years too early to be holding hands with a girl at school!

07:48.850 --> 07:50.300
So it's okay for you guys?

07:55.140 --> 07:57.540
Tenko and I are like family!

07:57.950 --> 08:01.250
That's why we don't keep talking about being in love like you guys do!

08:01.650 --> 08:02.660
Yeah! That's right!

08:02.900 --> 08:04.540
It's not like we're in love or anything!

08:13.250 --> 08:16.480
You wouldn't say that we're in love, would you...

08:19.750 --> 08:21.860
To Kamiyama Tenko

08:23.010 --> 08:23.700
What's this?

08:24.630 --> 08:25.680
Tenko!

08:25.680 --> 08:27.040
Is that a love letter?

08:27.210 --> 08:28.580
What? No way!

08:30.650 --> 08:31.940
Nakamura Takashi?

08:32.560 --> 08:33.940
Oh yeah, from class B!

08:33.940 --> 08:36.720
He doesn't stand out, but he seems like a good person!

08:36.930 --> 08:39.040
That must be a love letter, right?

08:39.150 --> 08:40.520
No way...

08:42.460 --> 08:43.170
Hey, hey!

08:43.210 --> 08:44.610
Is that okay with you, Samatarou?

08:44.870 --> 08:49.110
Oh wait, you guys aren't in love, right?

08:51.260 --> 08:54.080
That's right, I'm actually happy about it!

08:54.460 --> 08:58.940
If Tenko gets a boyfriend, then she'll stop butting in on everything I do!

08:58.940 --> 09:02.510
What? I'm not butting into your business because I like you!

09:03.460 --> 09:04.890
Then why not go out with him?

09:04.890 --> 09:07.180
Now who's the one that's butting in?!

09:22.360 --> 09:27.380
Samatarou really is different from when Papa still spoiled him...

09:29.270 --> 09:32.800
Like how he tried his best to make his first love happen without anyone else helping,

09:41.270 --> 09:43.570
And saying he wanted to become human.

09:44.500 --> 09:49.030
Seeing Samatarou try his best like that is what made Papa decide to start working from Heaven again.

09:53.340 --> 09:55.550
Kamiyama

09:55.930 --> 09:58.260
Note: They're watching a Manzai-style comedy act.

09:58.290 --> 10:01.920
These are horribly difficult to translate, and since they're not relevant to the actual story, we're not going to torture ourselves or you with an attempt. If you want more information on Manzai, there's a decent article on Wikipedia.

10:02.730 --> 10:04.020
To Kamiyama Tenko

10:15.450 --> 10:17.300
For crying out loud!

10:39.220 --> 10:43.560
Am I just a nosy angel to Samatarou?

10:46.410 --> 10:47.550
Here's dessert!

10:47.550 --> 10:50.710
Oh, I was just thinking that I wanted dessert!

10:50.880 --> 10:52.820
Tenko, it's like you can read my mind!

10:53.240 --> 10:54.020
Where's Samatarou?

10:54.280 --> 10:55.660
He went upstairs.

10:55.760 --> 10:56.230
Oh.

10:56.560 --> 10:57.890
Just leave him alone.

10:58.190 --> 11:00.790
Anyway, I heard you got a love letter?

11:00.950 --> 11:02.370
What? How do you know...

11:02.770 --> 11:06.480
A candidate for goddess wouldn't let something like that get by her, would she?

11:06.860 --> 11:09.470
Oh my, Tenko! That's wonderful!

11:09.760 --> 11:12.580
If I'd known, I'd want to meet the boy!

11:12.670 --> 11:14.630
Mama, something's wrong about that.

11:14.650 --> 11:15.160
Oh?

11:15.720 --> 11:17.720
Samatarou's in that kind of mood, too.

11:18.000 --> 11:20.110
Tenko, think positively for once!

11:20.330 --> 11:22.460
Misa, you're full of jokes!

11:24.350 --> 11:25.560
Takamura Takashi

11:27.470 --> 11:31.690
But... is it really okay like this?

11:32.650 --> 11:34.320
Don't use this!
Misa's only!

11:38.930 --> 11:43.880
If Samatarou keeps becoming a better person, and one day becomes a full god...

11:44.550 --> 11:46.980
What am I supposed to do then?

12:14.020 --> 12:17.830
Even then, if Samatarou still needs me around...

12:18.640 --> 12:21.460
I'll always be by his side.

12:23.650 --> 12:25.980
Tenko. Tenko!

12:38.740 --> 12:39.620
Tenko.

12:43.680 --> 12:45.790
Tenko. Tenko!

12:47.790 --> 12:48.850
Is that you, Papa?

12:55.170 --> 12:56.970
Samatarou? Samatarou?

12:57.170 --> 13:00.390
Quiet down... I'm sleepy.

13:03.580 --> 13:04.700
Then who is it?

13:05.090 --> 13:08.120
Who I am is of little consequence.

13:08.930 --> 13:11.880
Much more important is the task I have for you.

13:15.000 --> 13:16.440
A task... for me?

13:17.130 --> 13:20.660
Tenko, it seems your duty here is now over.

13:22.980 --> 13:25.540
Isn't it about time for you to come back to Heaven?

13:25.890 --> 13:27.070
T-that's...

13:28.020 --> 13:29.800
What was your duty?

13:30.850 --> 13:36.450
Guard Samatarou until he goes from being a candidate for a god to a real one, correct?

13:36.940 --> 13:37.400
Yes.

13:38.190 --> 13:42.900
Samatarou wants to go down the path of life on his own.

13:43.680 --> 13:46.560
Isn't your job over now?

13:47.310 --> 13:49.980
It's true. Samatarou has changed a lot.

13:50.560 --> 13:51.760
But he's still a kid!

13:52.150 --> 13:53.890
He hasn't learned nearly enough yet on his own!

13:54.300 --> 13:56.200
That's why I still need to stick around!

13:57.700 --> 13:59.550
Do you really think that?

14:01.100 --> 14:02.690
Your confidence is wavering, isn't it?

14:03.460 --> 14:06.610
You wonder if it's okay to still be near Samatarou.

14:08.020 --> 14:12.260
You are of no use if you stay by his side while harboring those feelings.

14:13.120 --> 14:18.110
From now, you must believe in Samatarou's own willpower and remove yourself from his life!

14:18.420 --> 14:23.380
No way... Who are you? Why are you saying things like that to me?

14:23.380 --> 14:24.270
Stop it already!

14:26.010 --> 14:28.090
Samatarou... Samatarou...!

14:28.380 --> 14:29.660
Do you think that, too?

14:30.830 --> 14:32.650
That you don't need me anymore...

14:38.700 --> 14:39.340
Tenko?

14:48.490 --> 14:50.010
That voice from yesterday...

14:51.460 --> 14:53.860
Tenko, it seems your duty here is now over.

14:55.220 --> 14:56.570
Who could that have been?

14:57.670 --> 15:02.900
But, just as the voice had said... If I'm not needed anymore...

15:03.800 --> 15:07.370
Then I should go be by the side of someone who really does need me.

15:13.420 --> 15:14.940
This is nice!

15:14.940 --> 15:18.240
For once, we're able to eat breakfast all together as a family.

15:18.240 --> 15:19.480
But Papa's not here...

15:19.480 --> 15:22.910
Yeah, he's always up in Heaven...

15:22.910 --> 15:25.790
He should come down here and viist one of these days.

15:26.410 --> 15:28.320
Mama's so sad!

15:28.410 --> 15:30.320
Maybe I'll go up there to play!

15:30.320 --> 15:31.660
Sure, sure.

15:34.130 --> 15:35.340
Tenko, you klutz!

15:35.340 --> 15:36.010
Dummy!

15:36.540 --> 15:36.990
Yeah.

15:39.190 --> 15:42.800
Well Tenko, you're just about the right age to start getting love letters, too.

15:43.250 --> 15:45.300
It's not unreasonable for you to be spacing out like that.

15:45.450 --> 15:45.940
Eh?!

15:47.380 --> 15:48.520
It's not like that...!

15:53.770 --> 15:55.820
It's 'cause you aren't being straight-forward with her!

15:56.610 --> 15:59.800
W-what? What's that supposed to mean?

16:00.230 --> 16:04.140
At this rate, there's no way Tenko isn't going to leave you.

16:04.310 --> 16:05.650
So what?

16:07.520 --> 16:08.330
Take her in your arms!

16:09.970 --> 16:11.780
What's wrong, Samatarou?

16:11.970 --> 16:14.270
N-n-I'm fine.

16:14.440 --> 16:15.450
Here's some tea.

16:15.740 --> 16:16.490
Thank you.

16:18.620 --> 16:20.850
Get your act together and get her on the floor!

16:21.520 --> 16:22.810
Samatarou!

16:22.810 --> 16:24.640
Samatarou, are you okay?

16:25.440 --> 16:27.240
Thanks for the food.

16:28.060 --> 16:29.760
Sis, you little...

16:35.700 --> 16:36.450
Embrace her!

16:39.330 --> 16:41.070
Samatarou!

16:46.320 --> 16:48.500
What kind of relationship do Tenko and I have...

16:53.210 --> 16:55.660
Basically, just a god and his guardian...

16:56.220 --> 16:57.830
That's all, isn't it?

16:56.220 --> 16:57.830
<i>That's all, right?</i>

16:59.830 --> 17:00.560
Yeah...

17:02.690 --> 17:03.190
But...

17:05.380 --> 17:05.960
Tenko.

17:07.770 --> 17:08.310
Um...

17:13.410 --> 17:15.640
I'm Nakamura Takashi from Class B.

17:19.880 --> 17:24.230
He's the guy that gave Tenko the love letter.

17:29.910 --> 17:32.640
Tenko, what are you two talking about?

17:34.270 --> 17:39.000
Don't tell me you're going to forget your duty as an angel and go out with some guy?

17:39.480 --> 17:41.710
Do you think I can forgive you for something like that?

17:42.290 --> 17:44.080
What, you saw it?

17:44.860 --> 17:46.490
Well, I didn't see it, but...

17:46.730 --> 17:50.130
But it is true that our homeroom teacher went into the principal's office.

17:50.470 --> 17:52.270
Shinichi, what's wrong?

17:52.430 --> 17:56.340
Ai! Well, it's nothing to be worried about.

17:59.850 --> 18:06.610
Hey, listen, I had like two popsicles yesterday, like three the day before that, and like four before that, you know.

18:05.510 --> 18:06.540
<i>Aren't you eating a little too much?</i>

18:06.740 --> 18:09.580
I don't know what's wrong with me!

18:09.330 --> 18:10.630
<i>Yeah, seriously!</i>

18:10.630 --> 18:11.550
I know!

18:12.520 --> 18:14.220
So, how'd it go?

18:14.950 --> 18:16.780
Oh, are you concerned about me?

18:16.910 --> 18:22.260
Well, seeing as I'm the Son of God and you're the angel that's supposed to watch over me.

18:23.120 --> 18:24.070
Is that it?

18:24.330 --> 18:25.250
That's all!

18:25.640 --> 18:30.130
Even then, you ignore your job as an angel and go off and have fun with some other guy!

18:30.130 --> 18:31.020
You were watching me?

18:32.850 --> 18:35.040
Well, maybe... a little.

18:35.620 --> 18:37.660
Hey, you're the bad one here!

18:37.840 --> 18:40.090
You're not taking your job as an angel seriously!

18:43.970 --> 18:46.250
Don't worry. I turned him down.

18:46.380 --> 18:46.910
What?

18:49.340 --> 18:50.440
I gave him back his letter, too.

18:52.350 --> 18:53.170
I'm sorry.

19:02.680 --> 19:05.760
Oh? You can be pretty harsh, Tenko.

19:05.970 --> 19:09.010
You might not get another chance like that!

19:09.560 --> 19:11.010
I'm fine with that!

19:10.880 --> 19:13.010
Ow! You..!

19:13.010 --> 19:13.970
Time to run!

19:13.970 --> 19:15.200
Hey, wait up!

19:16.130 --> 19:17.260
Ow...

19:17.260 --> 19:21.540
You, you won't be able to get any guys if you act like this!

19:21.540 --> 19:22.340
I'm fine with that.

19:22.340 --> 19:24.510
Who cares if I'm not popular with guys!

19:24.510 --> 19:25.370
Kamiyama!

19:42.820 --> 19:43.750
Kumiko!

19:44.930 --> 19:47.980
It's me, Komori. I've come back!

19:54.410 --> 19:55.250
Kumiko...

19:57.190 --> 19:57.900
Why?

20:10.830 --> 20:12.720
What? Why, why?

20:12.720 --> 20:15.110
I thought I'd never be able to see you again!

20:15.750 --> 20:18.550
I'm so glad you've come back, Kumiko!

20:18.700 --> 20:21.000
Your hairstyle is wonderful, as usual!

20:23.880 --> 20:26.810
SHINICHI, you asshole! We're breaking up!

20:28.620 --> 20:30.830
Ai, that was just me being friendly!

20:30.880 --> 20:32.450
You've got too much "friendliness" in you!

20:32.450 --> 20:35.030
Sorry! Ai, that hurts, that hurts!
I'm sorry! Oww!

20:35.010 --> 20:36.320
Jerk, jerk, jerk!

20:40.100 --> 20:41.610
It's really great to see you again!

20:41.950 --> 20:44.920
Kamiyama, Tenko. Aren't you surprised?

20:45.310 --> 20:45.950
Yeah...

20:46.250 --> 20:47.050
Something like that...

20:51.290 --> 20:52.560
Oh yeah, Kamiyama.

20:53.140 --> 20:55.400
Can you come up to the roof with me?

21:05.740 --> 21:08.220
Why do you think I came back?

21:09.850 --> 21:11.940
Something to do with your family affairs, right?

21:13.590 --> 21:16.650
I came back to see you.

21:16.890 --> 21:17.720
WHAT?

21:18.330 --> 21:19.360
Just kidding.

21:20.910 --> 21:22.370
Oh, well I guess that's obvious...

21:22.800 --> 21:23.400
But...

21:24.720 --> 21:27.380
The part about wanting to see you really was true!

21:34.910 --> 21:36.370
Go out with me.

21:38.310 --> 21:39.990
Please, go out with me.

21:54.060 --> 21:56.870
Looks like this has gotten complicated yet again...

22:17.720 --> 22:20.950
Really... what am I to Samatarou?

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
aru asa totsuzen (uh huh) sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
The world suddenly changed one morning

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh) kimi ni kissu sareru no (sareru no)

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
dakara atashi kara ippo fumidasu kedo

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
suki na taipu kiite kata wo otoshita

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
atama ni doonatsu wo nosete mitemo

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
Even if you put a doughnut over your head

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
kore dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nainai kana)

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
It wouldn't be enough to make you look like an angel!

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) kiru sugita maegami

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
Oh please, God! Allow the bangs I cut too short

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
sugu modoshitai nanto ka shiteyo

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
To grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
kotaenasai

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
Please answer my prayer!

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga niaeba

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:03.880 --> 24:06.780
If he really does go out with Kumiko, what's Tenko going to do?

24:06.780 --> 24:09.250
Why's that matter? She and I are...

24:09.250 --> 24:10.010
